/**
 * The Privacy Policy and Terms of Service, in every language the app ships.
 *
 * Kept out of index.ts on purpose: legal text changes on a different schedule
 * from interface copy, and it should be reviewable as one document rather than
 * scattered through UI keys.
 *
 * The English text is the authoritative version and every screen says so
 * (`legal_authoritative`). These translations are here so a driver can actually
 * read what they are agreeing to; they are not a substitute for a lawyer's
 * review in a market where the local language is legally binding.
 */

